{"title":"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/1/441416e660d25335f27e55334ac2a06e51541c97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"19\" /> is the greatest integer less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/561c088e6fbf7477298982cccde43fbef0b4a73e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{N=1}^{1024} \\lfloor \\log_{2}N\\rfloor =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"114\" height=\"50\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/d/cadee2f056f4307b432a7017de6b9c0d213ed95e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 8192\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 8204\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 9218\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\lfloor\\log_{2}(1024!)\\rfloor\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"610\" height=\"19\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/5/e45062c7ee2b5f4f75079a1f6041bf7b44977230.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\le N \\le 1024$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"110\" height=\"15\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/4/d94822bd345a91a977fa59d1fb0aa01a8940ae4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le \\lfloor \\log_{2}N\\rfloor \\le 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"142\" height=\"19\" />. We count how many times <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/c/8ccd0630793bcde245f5024c445f3cbe73c844fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor \\log_{2}N\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"63\" height=\"19\" /> attains a certain value. \n</p><p>For all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> except for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/f/3afd9b066c6c1fb6ef4383cb93bbabe6521c36d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/f/2dfd30a0d4ceb97a314c7e9313260147240f05cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor \\log_{2}N\\rfloor = k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"100\" height=\"19\" /> is satisfied by all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/d/03d0f038b3abccf948bd2abf8934abe102ce7586.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^k \\le N&lt;2^{k+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"114\" height=\"18\" />, for a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/7/767b7dc4a8df95a9f8a0faa3bb155e7b49943407.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"17\" /> values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/f/3afd9b066c6c1fb6ef4383cb93bbabe6521c36d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> can only have one value (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/7/da71769d1ec830021f848b46e771dc6ee3ba602a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=1024$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"77\" height=\"13\" />). Thus, the desired sum looks like <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/2/6f2bd2a40b24399baad3361cbbf012d439d3d75e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{N=1}^{1024} \\lfloor \\log_{2}N\\rfloor =1(0)+2(1)+4(2)+\\dots+2^k(k)+\\dots+2^{9}(9)+10\\]\" width=\"479\" height=\"50\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> be the desired sum without the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/3/673f9d702a801f6dedc57bece152cc990950d274.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S=2(1)+4(2)+\\dots+2^{9}(9)\\]\" width=\"226\" height=\"19\" /> Multiplying by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/7/9b716e8bdc620e17312e5782a878274fb59e7437.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2S=4(1)+8(2)+\\dots+2^{10}(9)\\]\" width=\"242\" height=\"20\" /> Subtracting the two equations gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d56a1d3cf75fe0c654aa25db520ad52e1ed2171.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S=2^{10}(9)-(2+4+8+\\dots+2^9)\\]\" width=\"271\" height=\"19\" /> Summing the geometric sequence in parentheses and simplifying, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/e/7ae2a3382435635363159f0296988f1c14c3ce60.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S=2^{10}(9)-2^{10}+2=2^{10}(8)+2=8194\\]\" width=\"321\" height=\"19\" /> Finally, adding back the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> gives the desired answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/e/2ee6253da61110cfc783e21f8e795ad95fb2a784.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{(B) 8204}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"75\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME\" title=\"1986 AHSME\">1986 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" 